# Campaign Workshop — environment
#
# WORKSHOP_VAULT_ROOT points at the Marketing department folder in Ernest's vault.
# When it is set, boards are read from and written to the vault and the automations
# downstream pick them up. When it is UNSET the app still works — it falls back to
# browser storage, which is also how a client-facing deployment runs, since a client
# has no vault. Never commit a real path; this file is the example only.
#
# WORKSHOP_VAULT_ROOT=C:\path\to\your\vault\Marketing

# Set to "1" to allow writes. Reads work with the root alone; writing is opt-in
# so a misconfigured deployment can never modify the vault.
# WORKSHOP_VAULT_WRITE=1
